From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:01:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign portfolio for recruiters while preserving existing
 functionality

- Restyle via design tokens in globals.css (token names unchanged, values
  switched to the new light theme); swap fonts via next/font
- Add /work page with case studies; rewrite Home and About content
- Move all copy into content/portfolio.ts with todo() placeholders and
  an `npm run check:content` script
- Header: Work/About/Contact; mobile drawer and active-link logic kept,
  aria-expanded/aria-current added
- Footer: links Services and Community (kept live), all socials kept
- Contact: same Formspree form (xaqrejbv), fields, reset and states;
  adds "Job opportunity" topic; social links now open in a new tab
- Services: Learn More links to /contact; FAQ accordion moved here from Home
- Per-page metadata now applies (was silently ignored in components),
  plus canonical URLs, Open Graph and Person JSON-LD
- Input borders meet 3:1 contrast

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012Ls8GSLtdmfpf42uCDiLxU
